ough traffic, and shoot pizzas at houses to earn money.\n\nUse your earnings to unlock new areas and buy businesses to grow your operation. With intuitive VR controls and engaging mechanics, Last Call Delivery delivers a fast-paced, hands-on driving and delivery experience you won\u2019t forget.", "short_description": "Last Call Delivery is a chaotic, funny delivery game where you drive around town shooting pizzas at houses to make money. Use your earnings to unlock new areas and buy businesses as you slowly take over the city"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lastcalldeliveryprivatepolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jaime ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lastcalldeliveryprivatepolicy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26700930126224299"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25793704983636922"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "25793704983636922"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1778040000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25793704983636922"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26906105332373443", "version": "0.3"}, "id": "1550667202875464", "channel_name": "LI